msgstr "manpages;man;"

#: ../data/manpages.scope.in.h:2
msgid "Manpages"
msgstr "Manpages"

#: ../data/manpages.scope.in.h:3
msgid ""
"This is an Ubuntu search plugin that enables information from local manpages "
"to be searched and displayed in the Dash underneath the Code header. If you "
"do not wish to search this content source, you can disable this search "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Seo plugan luirg aig Ubuntu a bheir comas dhut fiosrachadh a lorg ann am "
"manpages ionadail agus an sealltainn air an deas-bhòrd fon bhann-chinn chòd. "
"Mur eil thu airson lorg a dhèanamh san tùs susbaint seo, 's urrainn dhut am "
"plugan luirg seo a chur à comas."

#: ../data/manpages.scope.in.h:4
msgid "Search for Manpages"
msgstr "Lorg sna Manpages"
